---
title: Implemented playtest I/O and replay handoff
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant M as Main JS page adapter
    participant R as Page-hosted Rust WASM
    participant W as JS I/O worker
    participant J as Rust replay Timeline
    participant C as Canvas
    Note over R: Keep active room on stale or required-data failure
    Note over R,J: Complete replay is separate from the small debug ring.<br/>Historical imports need retained digest-addressed level bytes.
    M->>R: Select level
    R-->>M: Asset and generation
    M->>W: read asset and request ID
    W-->>M: Owned bytes or failure
    M->>R: Accept bytes with generation
    R->>R: Verify and prepare candidate
    M->>R: Input edges and elapsed time
    R->>R: Advance bounded fixed ticks
    R->>J: Seal outgoing input segment
    R->>R: Activate next room epoch
    R-->>M: FGS1 world and matching FGP1 pose
    M->>C: Draw committed view
